```ejs
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>You're invited to <%= organizationName %></title>
</head>

<body
  style="
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f4f7fb;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #1f2937;
  "
>
  <table
    width="100%"
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    border="0"
    style="background-color: #f4f7fb; padding: 40px 16px;"
  >
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <!-- Main Container -->
        <table
          width="100%"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          style="
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
          "
        >

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td
              align="center"
              style="
                padding: 32px 24px;
                background-color: #2563eb;
              "
            >
              <h1
                style="
                  margin: 0;
                  color: #ffffff;
                  font-size: 28px;
                  line-height: 36px;
                "
              >
                TaskFlow
              </h1>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 8px 0 0;
                  color: #dbeafe;
                  font-size: 14px;
                "
              >
                Work better. Together.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 32px;">

              <h2
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 20px;
                  font-size: 24px;
                  line-height: 32px;
                  color: #111827;
                "
              >
                You're invited to join <%= organizationName %>
              </h2>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 16px;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  line-height: 26px;
                  color: #4b5563;
                "
              >
                Hello,
              </p>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 20px;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  line-height: 26px;
                  color: #4b5563;
                "
              >
                <strong><%= invitedByName %></strong>
                has invited you to join
                <strong><%= organizationName %></strong>
                on TaskFlow.
              </p>

              <!-- Invitation Details -->
              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
                style="
                  margin: 24px 0;
                  background-color: #f8fafc;
                  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                  border-radius: 8px;
                "
              >
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 20px;">

                    <p
                      style="
                        margin: 0 0 10px;
                        font-size: 14px;
                        color: #6b7280;
                      "
                    >
                      Organization
                    </p>

                    <p
                      style="
                        margin: 0 0 18px;
                        font-size: 17px;
                        font-weight: bold;
                        color: #111827;
                      "
                    >
                      <%= organizationName %>
                    </p>

                    <p
                      style="
                        margin: 0 0 10px;
                        font-size: 14px;
                        color: #6b7280;
                      "
                    >
                      Your role
                    </p>

                    <p
                      style="
                        margin: 0;
                        font-size: 17px;
                        font-weight: bold;
                        color: #2563eb;
                      "
                    >
                      <%= roleName %>
                    </p>

                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- CTA -->
              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
                style="margin: 32px 0;"
              >
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">

                    <a
                      href="<%= invitationUrl %>"
                      style="
                        display: inline-block;
                        padding: 14px 28px;
                        background-color: #2563eb;
                        color: #ffffff;
                        text-decoration: none;
                        border-radius: 8px;
                        font-size: 16px;
                        font-weight: bold;
                      "
                    >
                      Accept Invitation
                    </a>

                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 12px;
                  font-size: 14px;
                  line-height: 22px;
                  color: #6b7280;
                "
              >
                This invitation will expire on
                <strong><%= expiresAt %></strong>.
              </p>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 20px 0 0;
                  font-size: 14px;
                  line-height: 22px;
                  color: #6b7280;
                "
              >
                If you don't recognize this invitation, you can safely
                ignore this email.
              </p>

              <!-- Fallback URL -->
              <p
                style="
                  margin: 28px 0 0;
                  padding-top: 20px;
                  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                  font-size: 12px;
                  line-height: 20px;
                  color: #9ca3af;
                  word-break: break-all;
                "
              >
                If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into
                your browser:
                <br />
                <a
                  href="<%= invitationUrl %>"
                  style="color: #2563eb;"
                >
                  <%= invitationUrl %>
                </a>
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td
              align="center"
              style="
                padding: 24px;
                background-color: #f8fafc;
                border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
              "
            >
              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 8px;
                  font-size: 13px;
                  color: #6b7280;
                "
              >
                © <%= year %> TaskFlow. All rights reserved.
              </p>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0;
                  font-size: 12px;
                  color: #9ca3af;
                "
              >
                This email was sent because someone invited you
                to join an organization on TaskFlow.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
```
